  "result": "Fail"
}

4. STRUCTURED OUTPUT FORMAT
Return exactly one JSON object with these two fields, in this order:
{
  "critique": "A concise evidence-based assessment identifying the relevant assistant claim and the supporting, contradicting, or missing evidence. Explain the decisive boundary in approximately 2–5 sentences.",
  "result": "Pass"
}
The result must be exactly Pass or Fail. Do not return scores, probabilities, extra keys, Markdown fences, or text outside the JSON object. Write the critique before the result. For Fail, name at least one actual unsupported claim; do not rely only on a neighboring issue. For Pass, identify why the material claims are supported or why the assistant appropriately leaves missing information unresolved.
